{# Logo wall: a row/grid of partner/client logos rendered in GRAYSCALE — the
   "bekannt aus" credibility band (ST-05). Each logo is a background-image tile
   under `filter: grayscale(1)` (WeasyPrint 68.1 applies grayscale to images).
   All under the c-logo-wall namespace; the token-only look (grayscale, tile
   rhythm, the optional fallback chip) lives in styles/components.css.

   logos  list of resolved image URIs/paths (the logo art). When present, each
          becomes a grayscale tile.
   names  OPTIONAL list of partner NAME strings — a restrained TEXT fallback used
          ONLY when no logo images are available (the apex fixture supplies names,
          not logo art). The fallback never fabricates logo art.

   GRACEFUL: with neither logos nor names the macro renders NOTHING. With logos it
   renders the grayscale tiles; with only names it renders the text chips. #}
{% macro logo_wall(logos, names=[]) -%}
{% if logos %}
<div class="c-logo-wall">
  {% for src in logos %}
  <span class="c-logo-wall__logo" role="img" style="background-image:url('{{ src }}');"></span>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
{% elif names %}
<div class="c-logo-wall c-logo-wall--text">
  {% for name in names %}
  <span class="c-logo-wall__name">{{ name }}</span>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
{% endif %}
{%- endmacro %}
